rows.abstract:
Seeks to augment the law to make this more effective in addressing future outbreaks by:   
(1)	establishing sub-national laboratories in all DOH-run hospitals; 
(2)	establishment of hotlines and other forms of access for reporting of diseases and public health events; 
(3)	requiring the DOH to issue clear guidelines on the systematic reporting and recording of such diseases and events of public health concern; and 
(4)	requiring all public and private institutions to provide the necessary information in disease surveillance and other epidemiologic investigations.
